WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.361 --> 00:00:03.111
(haunting music)

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.775
- [Voiceover] Situated
above the Arctic Circle,

00:00:07.775 --> 00:00:10.079
Pyramiden is home to the ghostly remnants

00:00:10.079 --> 00:00:14.246
of a lost Soviet industrial
way of life, frozen in time.

00:00:15.947 --> 00:00:18.159
This now abandoned mining
town was established

00:00:18.159 --> 00:00:21.399
in the early 20th century on
the Norwegian archipelago,

00:00:21.399 --> 00:00:25.157
Svalbard, and was named after
the pyramid-shaped mountain

00:00:25.157 --> 00:00:26.946
that looms in the distance.

00:00:26.946 --> 00:00:30.446
(haunting dramatic music)

00:00:40.549 --> 00:00:42.223
A walk through this place is a step back

00:00:42.223 --> 00:00:45.451
in time to past Soviet glory.

00:00:45.451 --> 00:00:46.667
Remnants of Soviet culture, art,

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:49.236
Remnants of Soviet culture, art,

00:00:49.236 --> 00:00:51.929
and architecture still stand today.

00:00:51.929 --> 00:00:54.679
(haunting music)

00:00:57.179 --> 00:00:59.770
It is predicted that due
to the low rate of decay

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:02.855
in a frigid climate the
abandoned town's major buildings

00:01:02.855 --> 00:01:06.468
will still be visible 500 years from now.

00:01:06.468 --> 00:01:09.723
That's longer than any other
modern settlement on Earth.

00:01:09.723 --> 00:01:13.223
(haunting dramatic music)

